cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software

title: "Reproduction package for the undici version-matrix experiment"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction package accompanying the manuscript "Silent Network Failures in
  Hybrid Runtimes: Diagnosing Dependency Resolution Escape via In-Runtime
  Differential Probing". The package runs a 65-cell controlled experiment that
  crosses four JavaScript runtimes (two bundled undici lineages) with four
  external undici versions under six dispatcher strategies, and counts the TCP
  connections each cell actually opens in order to distinguish requests that
  were rejected by a client-side contract assertion from requests that were
  really sent. It reproduces Tables 3, 4, 5 and 6 of the manuscript.

